## Protobuf Hashing Implementation Plan & SmartContract Removal

**I. Introduction**

This plan outlines the steps to transition your KNIRVCHAIN project to use Protobuf for hashing both blocks and transactions, and to remove the `SmartContract` struct. This will enhance the determinism and robustness of your hashing mechanisms.

