**X. Database Invalidation**

Reiterate to yourself: After these changes, your existing blockchain database will be incompatible. The genesis block hash will change due to the new hashing mechanism. You must delete the old database files (e.g., `~/.config/KNIRVCHAIN/data/agent.db`) before running the application with these modifications to start a fresh chain.

This plan provides a solid foundation for transitioning to Protobuf-based hashing. It's a significant update that will enhance the robustness and consistency of your blockchain. Take it step-by-step, test thoroughly, and you'll have a much stronger system!
